  "name": "ff",
  "description": "A pure Rust library providing core traits and procedural macros for efficient finite field arithmetic. It facilitates the definition of prime fields via a derive macro that generates optimized, Montgomery-reduced arithmetic without using unsafe code. The architecture supports performance-critical cryptographic primitives such as those used in elliptic curve and zero-knowledge proof systems.",
